            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="about_content mt-45 wow fadeInLeftBig" data-wow-duration="1.3s" data-wow-delay="0.5s">
                    <h4 class="about_title">About Ampersand</h4>
                    <p>Ampersand Cooperative Society is a member-owned business organization 
                        built on principles of shared ownership, democratic governance, and collective benefit. 
                        Unlike traditional corporations, we prioritize people over profit—each member holds an equal voice in 
                        decision-making regardless of investment size. Our cooperative model fosters community resilience, 
                        equitable wealth distribution, and sustainable growth through pooled resources and shared responsibilities. 
                        Members contribute capital, participate in operations, and receive proportional returns based on engagement 
                        rather than equity stake. Guided by values of self-help, solidarity, and social responsibility, 
                        Ampersand empowers individuals to collaboratively address economic needs—from financial services and housing 
                        to agricultural production or retail—while reinvesting surpluses into community development. We operate 
                        transparently under cooperative bylaws, 
                    ensuring accountability and inclusive prosperity for all stakeholders.</p>
                    <ul class="social">
                        <li><a href="#"><i class="lni lni-facebook-filled"></i></a></li>
